{"id":"663443","name":"胡萝卜炒甘蓝","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/663443/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"甘蓝","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜蓉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"南方小胡萝卜洗净去皮切成片，蒜蓉。","img":"images/663443/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"甘蓝切成丝状。","img":"images/663443/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中放入适量的食用油烧热，下入胡萝卜片翻炒。","img":"images/663443/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入甘蓝丝，料酒、盐、翻炒。","img":"images/663443/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入蒜蓉翻炒。","img":"images/663443/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"散入鸡精即可出锅。","img":"images/663443/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盛入盘中，做为早餐菜肴。","img":"images/663443/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}